	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "A4jBiHwmEYFvCRoem",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 0, DX 8, IQ 0, HT 12, HP 25, WILL 0, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 5, MOVE 2, DODGE 8, DR —. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AlQTnAnqKN0ZQkGTG",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 27 (offense 18, protection 9), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "ABQKWkHPvb6RmlR22",
			"text": "Acid (Corrosion Aura) (1d-1 corrosion per second), reach C: No attack roll and no active defense. Always on, no attack roll. Any fleshy creature touching the jelly takes 1d-1 corrosion per second. The acid dissolves flesh only; it does not harm metal, stone or equipment. Selective."
		},
		{
			"id": "AOZtDRNhpQzIGhjH5",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/ochre-jelly.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "ACufuHnvnx1jsh5bH",
			"text": "Source template total: -116 points."
		},
		{
			"id": "AmHbGAnlgWWv2WpCs",
