		},
		{
			"id": "Ad7Tyzg4VHx4HHDRz",
			"text": "CER was computed from parsed Typical Stats using the Dungeons On Automatic baseline CER path."
		},
		{
			"id": "AkHWb1CRuSg1Vq6Bq",
			"text": "Review attacks, special abilities, encounter frequency, treasure, grappling, and GCS modifiers before approval."
		},
		{
			"id": "A7_QrJA22d1thYDvT",
			"text": "Size 7 hexes; Weight 5,600 lbs."
		},
		{
			"id": "AjS0HoEIZZgCXjJ0x",
			"text": "Injury Tolerance (Diffuse; Infiltration): the jelly flows through gaps and cannot be crippled, and takes reduced damage from most physical blows."
		},
